' '--task' 'fixture-20261014-1' '--attempt' '1a4f9cde-bbf3-46dd-8376-7402fde87df3' '--session' 'c4042497-d369-46a6-9eca-ba7b64d9b509' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":24,"time":"2026-10-14T04:54:52.781Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"1a4f9cde-bbf3-46dd-8376-7402fde87df3","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt_id":"1a4f9cde-bbf3-46dd-8376-7402fde87df3","session_id":"c4042497-d369-46a6-9eca-ba7b64d9b509","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"ffefd410-b2e8-4e31-b421-2c7c7c47c7a5","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"7f7ba27a-1e3f-44ca-be9c-e39a907d7d96","thread":"ffefd410-b2e8-4e31-b421-2c7c7c47c7a5","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-7f7ba27a-1e3f-44ca-be9c-e39a907d7d96"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-wbee3r14/c-p4q885up/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261014-1-a1","base_commit":"b46637b78afbd0f60342503facec98d0954e6bc1","card_snapshot_id":"2ca0bd82-571e-4378-9e77-c7c72dce9175","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261014-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":25,"time":"2026-10-14T04:54:54.303Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"1a4f9cde-bbf3-46dd-8376-7402fde87df3","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-wbee3r14/c-p4q885up/repo","cat-file","-t","476370e048efeb980b51f1f8d044d8db2529d5a0"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-wbee3r14/c-p4q885up/repo"}},{"seq":26,"time":"2026-10-14T04:54:54.338Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"1a4f9cde-bbf3-46dd-8376-7402fde87df3","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-wbee3r14/c-p4q885up/repo","cat-file","-t","476370e048efeb980b51f1f8d044d8db2529d5a0"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-